[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0010","text":"真乃。这次演唱会的服装设计稿\n出来了，能帮我看一下吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0020","text":"是、是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0030","text":"……哇……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0040","text":"嗯？有什么不对的地方吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0050","text":"……不、不是，对不起……\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0060","text":"……就是\n服装的颜色……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0070","text":"……我只是觉得\n好像鸽子啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0080","text":"──啊！\n你这么一说，确实"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0090","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_02_0100","text":"……好期待\n成品出来啊……"}]
